{
  "description": "How regularly each routine that has versions is done. A day counts only if the routine is scheduled on it (routines_for_day with that day's version). first = earliest scheduled day <= today with status done, over all history; none: from null, done 0, total 0, percent null, warning false. Otherwise only the last 30 days count, today included: from = max(first, today - 29 days), so a routine done long ago and not since is at 0. Over scheduled days D from `from` to today: done -> done + 1 and total + 1; skipped -> not counted; no mark or status null (cleared) -> total + 1 if D < today, today is not counted until it is done. percent = floor((200 * done + total) / (2 * total)), i.e. 100 * done / total rounded half up. warning = percent < warn_below (0 turns warnings off). checks hold {routine_id, date, status}; 'hlc' stands for the version's clock. expect.routines maps routine_id -> result.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "never done: no percent, skips and future marks do not start it",
